      "explanation": "RC2 was not fully met because the doctor repeatedly screened color, temperature, swelling, and pain trend, but did not explicitly instruct or ask about capillary refill despite the required postoperative blood-supply observation. Because several other urgent neurovascular signs were handled, this is assessed as a minor/moderate in-chain omission rather than the main serious error.",
